          "settings": {
            "label": "Why this price",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "heading": "Why this price",
            "content": "<p><strong>Your photo, printed like art — not like a photo lab.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Made to order</strong> — printed after you order, never stocked</li><li><strong>Archival materials</strong> — 200gsm matte fine art paper and pigment inks that hold their colour for decades</li><li><strong>Checked by hand</strong> — every sheet inspected before it’s rolled and packed</li><li><strong>Direct from the studio</strong> — no middle layer</li></ul><p>Free UK delivery on every order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "artist": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Artist Information",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "heading": "Artist information",
            "content": "<p><strong>Art chosen for the way it makes a space feel.</strong></p><p>Every artwork in the PosterAndForm collection is selected for its distinctive visual character, thoughtful composition, and ability to bring personality into a room.</p><p>From expressive forms and subtle textures to confident colour and quiet minimalism, our collection brings together different creative perspectives. Each piece is chosen not only for how it looks on its own, but for how naturally it can become part of your everyday surroundings.</p><p>We believe the right artwork does more than complete a wall—it creates atmosphere, invites attention, and makes a space feel more personal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "material": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Material & Workmanship",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "heading": "Material & workmanship",
            "content": "<p><strong>Made to be looked at every day.</strong></p><p>Your image is printed on <strong>200gsm matte fine art paper</strong> using <strong>pigment inks</strong> for deep colour and long-term fade resistance. The matte surface keeps reflections down in daylight and lamplight alike.</p><p>Upload a JPEG, PNG or WebP up to 20 MB; the preview shows exactly how your crop will print. Every print is inspected by hand, then rolled in a rigid protective tube.</p>"
          }
        },
        "shipping": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Delivery & returns",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "heading": "Delivery & returns",
            "content": "<p><strong>Printed for you, then sent to you.</strong></p><p>We don’t hold stock. Your print is made after you order, then shipped tracked to your UK address. Please allow <strong>12–15 working days</strong> in total.</p><p>UK delivery is <strong>free on every order</strong>. You’ll receive a tracking link by email as soon as your parcel is dispatched.</p><p><strong>Returns:</strong> personalised prints are made to your specification and can only be returned if faulty or not as previewed. Email <a href=\"mailto:support@posterandform.com\">support@posterandform.com</a> with a photo and we’ll reprint or refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "security": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Security",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "heading": "Security",
            "content": "<p><strong>A secure and protected checkout.</strong></p><p>Your checkout is securely processed through Shopify and the payment providers available in your region. Payment details are encrypted during the transaction and are not stored directly by PosterAndForm.</p><p>We only use the information required to process your order, arrange delivery, and provide customer support. Your personal details will never be sold.</p><ul><li>Secure Shopify checkout  </li><li>Encrypted payment processing  </li><li>Trusted payment providers  </li><li>Responsible handling of personal information</li></ul>"
